    "recipe_en": "<p>Peel and cut the plantains, then blend with the water until smooth.</p><p>Warm the coconut milk with cinnamon, vanilla, nutmeg and salt.</p><p>Pour in the plantain mixture slowly while whisking.</p><p>Cook over low heat for 12–15 minutes until creamy.</p><p>Add the sugar and lime zest.</p><p>Serve with sliced banana.</p>",
